OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FIt's an emotional last day for
OL,7,     Fnurse Bryony: after two years,
OL,8,     Fshe's moving to pastures new, but
OL,9,     Fnot before a good old Barnsley
OL,10,     Fsend-off from all her casualty
OL,11,     Fcolleagues.
OL,12,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FPolice bring in an abusive male
OL,14,     Funder arrest who claims he has a
OL,15,     Fracing heart, and two friends
OL,16,     Farrive in resus who have
OL,17,     Fdislocated each other's shoulders
OL,18,     Fduring a friendly wrestle.
