OL,5,G0100 Cold Case Killers
OL,6,     FIn 1978, trailblazing scientist Dr
OL,7,     FBrenda Page was found brutally
OL,8,     Fbeaten to death in her Aberdeen
OL,9,     Fhome. 40 years later, could a tiny
OL,10,     Ffleck of paint hold the key to
OL,11,     Fcatching her killer?
OL,12,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FThe IT systems have failed,
OL,14,     Fcausing chaos, but Casualty still
OL,15,     Fneed to treat a motorcycle courier
OL,16,     Fwho's had a head-on collision, and
OL,17,     Fa man with severe abdominal pains.
